bound-lock/1 about="Clone, `{check}`. A case that gives you a different answer is the contribution: send it with what it printed.\n{open} conjectures are open, each in the README under Open, and each says what would close it and who could.\nNothing else is asked. Lines land through the fold, never by hand; a page and the lock disagree, the lock is right." at=witness:the-root-spoke-for-the-place by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/contributing sig="ed25519:era1:UyXCUssH3zcg2kLhjWSNM/YtD9lo35lHphpGMw6V8hFaNDABiW+R50qbFDrsxjUMh3F52+wpGPV1efZiu28OBQ==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="What it printed is not what the lock pins for it: the example moved, and nobody declared it." at=witness:the-root-spoke-for-the-place by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/example/moved sig="ed25519:era1:qdA2FdtspkU9GBDbItyCMBNtmz+hz56v8kdBlvrF0H2noFKesizxM8k135QsB7lybpPAVzCqOAQOpzlUZQxbDQ==" value=lock
