bound-lock/1 about="A cell is drawn as bars on one scale: a grey bar is what one origin claims, potential until another meets it, and a green bar is where two claims meet, its ends the floor and the ceiling. A state carries its render in a figure, a badge and a graph alike: FREE green, REQUIRED grey, FORBIDDEN red, CONFLICT fork." at=witness:the-root-spoke-for-the-place by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/marks sig="ed25519:era1:FBgwAUi2yUm/lDSb7eJsVODHftjmMYuYxNZlIsBYor4YgkIv7BIOw9FnKm9H9LDXzAb6STktnDnCI9KZVH8ZBg==" value=lock
